21
00:00:36.303 --> 00:00:37.504
Cálmate.

22
00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:39.106
Los Hudson rara vez dan la cara,

23
00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:40.607
entonces este banquete es

24
00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.875
