30
00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.053
Pero papá...

31
00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.656
No te preocupes,

32
00:00:55.656 --> 00:00:56.456
tu papá tiene

33
00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.558
